  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "What was the deploy window for the catalog before it changed?\n[2025-11-12] standup/boreal/2025-11-12: The catalog service's deploy window changes today: it is now on Tuesdays and Thursdays between 10:00 and 12:00 UTC. The old slot (Mondays 10:00-12:00 UTC) is retired. [2025-05-02] standup/cinder/2025-05-02-2: The catalog deploy window: on Mondays between 10:00 and 12:00 UTC. Team Cinder holds planning on Mondays. [2025-09-26] standup/atlas/2025-09-26: For newcomers: the deploy window for the ledger service is still on Wednesdays between 09:00 and 11:00 UTC.",
